---
// Inverted section: dark plate with light copy, per the redesign.
---

<section id="living-hall" class="py-20 px-gutter bg-ink-deep text-paper">
  <div
    class="max-w-wrap mx-auto grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr))] gap-[clamp(44px,6vw,100px)] items-center"
  >
    <div>
      <h2
        class="font-inter font-semibold text-[clamp(26px,3.2vw,42px)] leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.008em] max-w-[520px]"
      >
        A <span class="text-accent-hover">24-foot</span> living hall, butterfly layout.
      </h2>
      <p
        class="font-inter text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-paper max-w-[560px] mt-7"
      >
        No bulkheads breaking the span, no beams cutting the room in half — just
        one uninterrupted 24-foot hall that takes a full dining set and a proper
        lounge without either feeling squeezed.
      </p>
      <p
        class="font-inter text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-paper max-w-[560px] mt-7"
      >
        Floor-to-ceiling glazing runs the full width, so daylight reaches every
        corner of the hall rather than fading past the first few feet — a living
        space that entertains as easily as it unwinds.
      </p>
      <a
        href="#residences"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-paper border-b border-accent-hover pb-1.5 transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-accent-hover mt-7"
      >
        View Layouts
        <svg
          width="15"
          height="15"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          ><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
        >
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="relative rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden">
      <img
        class="w-full h-auto"
        src="/assets/living-hall.webp"
        alt="Spacious living hall with grand piano, feature fireplace and Kuala Lumpur skyline views"
      />
      <span
        class="absolute bottom-4 left-[18px] text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-white/90 font-semibold [text-shadow:0_1px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"
        >Artist's Impression</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
